    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it doesn't feel like i matter though. everything feels so heavy and pointless. like, what's the point of struggling to keep up with all this noise just to end up being forgotten anyway? it feels more like i'm just taking up space that doesn't even belong to me. it would honestly be more peaceful if i just... gave up on trying so hard.",
